msgid "MINIGAME_NAME"
msgstr "Cookie Catch"

msgid "MINIGAME_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Cookies rain from the sky! Run around and catch as many as you can. Catch cookies in a row to build a combo: every five in a row add a bonus point.\n\nGolden cookies are worth three. Do not catch a bomb: it stuns you and costs you two cookies. Power-ups: a star makes you fast, a magnet pulls cookies in from afar and a shield blocks one bomb or one thief.\n\nWatch out: if you bump into a rival while running faster than they do, you steal a cookie! A golden rain falls in the middle of the game, and in the last 14 seconds a cookie storm breaks out. Who has the most cookies after 60 seconds wins!"

msgid "MINIGAME_ACTION_JUMP"
msgstr "Jump"

msgid "MINIGAME_ACTION_PULL"
msgstr "Pull (press as fast as you can)"
